    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & valuers are thrilled to bring Kilbrack, 33 Togher Road to the market. This  presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a well-proportioned detached bungalow situated on a nice-sized site, offering excellent potential for comfortable family living.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises a three-bedroom detached bungalow with well-balanced accommodation throughout. One of the standout features is the separate detached converted garage, which provides a versatile additional space and could suit a variety of uses including a home office, studio, gym, hobby room or additional living accommodation, subject to the necessary planning requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a good-sized site with excellent scope for outdoor entertaining, gardening or simply enjoying the privacy and space that comes with a detached home.\r\n\r\nWith its single-storey layout, generous site and valuable additional accommodation in the converted garage, Kilbrack offers a particularly appealing combination of space, versatility and potential.\r\n\r\nThis property is sure to attract interest from a wide range of buyers, including families, downsizers and those looking for a home with additional flexible space.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - \r\nLino flooring\r\n\r\nLiving room - 4.5m x 3.4m \r\nCarpet flooring, bay window and built display unit. Tile surround fire place \r\n\r\nDining room - 3.6m x 3.5m \r\nVinyl flooring with built in stove and door to kitchen \n\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nTile flooring, over counter tiles. Floor and eye level kitchen units, sink and drainer, door to rear garden  \n\r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\nWall and floor tiles, double shower tray with electric shower, wc and whb. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.4m \r\nDouble room to the front of the property over looking the garden with carpet flooring  \n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.1m \r\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nDouble room  to the rear of the house with carpet flooring \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE - \r\nDetached garage suitable for home office ,studio, gym, hobby room or additional living accommodation, subject to the necessary planning requirements.\nOff street parking to the front, lawned garden to front with manicured hedging and ample space at the rear and side.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Most sought after location\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nGreat schools and sports amenities nearby.\r\nDetached garage\r\nBuilt in 1939\r\nOff street parking for 2 cars\r\n2 minute walk to The Lough."
      },
      {
